      "content": "i know people say i should get a new pet or just \"move on\" but they dont get it. it feels like he was the only thing that actually made this life feel real. now it just feels like i'm going through the motions in a world that doesn't even care. like, what's the point of all this effort if everything that matters just disappears anyway?",
